      "entryId": "2026-08-30-pm-news-0",
      "headline": "DRAGON BALL GEKISHIN SQUADRA plans a third-person overhaul for late 2026",
      "summary": "Bandai Namco says the late-2026 renewal will replace the top-down camera with an over-the-shoulder third-person view, revise the rules and maps, and simplify role and related systems from Season 8.",
      "verification": "Bandai Namco's same-day press release confirms the overhaul; the opened AUTOMATON report establishes the event time and scope.",
      "timeNote": "The AUTOMATON report was published at 12:59 Beijing time, inside the fixed 10:10–17:00 window.",
